[OC]|cffffffffLevel check|r  -  this chapter wants level 33: the west half of the Kurzen compound and the Stranglethorn Raptors are 32-34, its east end (the strongbox, Witch Doctors and Elites) 36-37 and the Shadowmaw Panthers 37-38. Under 33 when you arrive: kill the young tigers and panthers round Nesingwary's camp (30-31) before you go into the compound. The Shadowmaw Panthers (Panther Mastery, 192) only at 34 or higher; under that, abandon the quest where the guide says
[OC]|cffffffffStranglethorn Vale|r  -  hearth = Southshore and it stays there (chapter 31 binds Booty Bay). About 45,400 quest XP is handed in here: two Dalaran quests in Stormwind, then the Rebel Camp and Nesingwary's three hunts, which share the north end of the zone, and one salvage job for Booty Bay. Every tiger, panther and raptor is a beast: skin them all (Expert Skinning from chapter 27; the Classic rule of 5 skill per mob level above 20 puts these at 150-175, |cffffcc00unverified|r on Forever). The Kurzen humans drop cloth for First Aid
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried on:|r Storm, Earth, and Fire (79358) for the totems from chapter 32, Loremaster Dibbs's three Drowned City quests (95787, 95788, 95798) and Talk of the Town (98463) for chapter 31, and the pickups for later chapters (707, 1453, 1050, 96800, 1248, 79192). Nothing here touches them
